{"v":1,"kind":"event","t":1792946423.08,"game_t":53.8,"ev":"choice","scene":"Gale: Why don't we take a little break? Allow ourselves a few moments of rest. Gives me a chance to talk to you about something, well, rather important.","options":[{"i":1,"text":"'Rather important' no less? All right, go ahead."},{"i":2,"text":"Whatever it is, do make it brief."},{"i":3,"text":"No rest for the likes of us, Gale."}],"picked":1,"picked_text":"'Rather important' no less? All right, go ahead.","at":1792946380.19}
{"v":1,"kind":"event","t":1792946423.08,"game_t":53.8,"ev":"choice","scene":"Gale: In short: I've grown to trust you.","options":[{"i":1,"text":"That's very gratifying to hear."},{"i":2,"text":"Enough with the flattery. Where is this going?"},{"i":3,"text":"Can't say the feeling's exactly mutual."}],"picked":1,"picked_text":"That's very gratifying to hear.","at":1792946384.29}
{"v":1,"kind":"event","t":1792946423.08,"game_t":53.8,"ev":"choice","scene":"Gale: You see, I have this... condition. Very different from the parasite we share, but just as deadly.","options":[{"i":1,"text":"What kind of condition?"},{"i":2,"text":"Is it contagious?"},{"i":3,"text":"Can it be cured?"},{"i":4,"text":"So you've been lying to me this whole time. Wonderful."}],"picked":1,"picked_text":"What kind of condition?","at":1792946387.75}
{"v":1,"kind":"event","t":1792946423.08,"game_t":53.8,"ev":"choice","scene":"Gale: What it comes down to is this: every so often I need to get my hands on a powerful magical item and absorb the Weave inside.","options":[{"i":1,"text":"Your illness causes you to consume raw magic? I'm going to need the details..."},{"i":2,"text":"What kind of items are we talking about exactly?"},{"i":3,"text":"Wouldn't that ruin the item?"},{"i":4,"text":"What happens if you don't consume these artefacts?"},{"i":5,"text":"Are you telling me you're addicted to magic?"}],"picked":2,"picked_text":"What kind of items are we talking about exactly?","at":1792946391.57}
{"v":1,"kind":"event","t":1792946423.08,"game_t":53.8,"ev":"choice","scene":"Gale: That is why I turn to you. I need you to help me find magic items to consume. It is vital. Dare I say it, critical.","options":[{"i":1,"text":"Where do you suggest we find the artefacts you need?"},{"i":2,"text":"I fail to see why you need me to help you with this. You've done fine without me so far."},{"i":3,"text":"I'd be happy to help."},{"i":4,"text":"Sounds like no 'condition' I've ever heard of. I'd say you're just fishing for loot."}],"picked":3,"picked_text":"I'd be happy to help.","at":1792946394.53}
